cff-version: 1.2.0
title: pd-score-corpus
message: >-
  If you use this curated subset, cite PDMX (Long et al.) and, as the
  PDMX authors request, MetaScore (Xu et al.). Cite this repository
  only for the allowlist/filter/manifest.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Lacasse
    given-names: Michael
date-released: "2026-09-02"
license: CC0-1.0
references:
