    pages: "1-5"
    doi: 10.1109/ICASSP49660.2025.10890217
    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.10831
    notes: >-
      Dataset: Zenodo record 15571083 (v9, 2025-06-01),
      DOI 10.5281/zenodo.15571083.
